{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01U8BqQVaAGcLSFFANFM9q3S","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PC2fpNoPcLsd4JPED1GQPP","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"gh pr create --title \"feat: add browsing history tracking and display\" --body \"$(cat <<'EOF'\n## Summary\n- Adds a `browsing_history` table to activity.db with columns: id, timestamp, domain, url, duration_seconds\n- Implements `BrowsingTracker` class that reads Firefox's `places.sqlite` every 30 seconds to capture visited URLs automatically while the kiosk runs\n- Adds `GET /api/browsing-history` endpoint with pagination (50 per page), date-range (`date_from`/`date_to`), and domain filter query params\n- Adds a new **Activity** tab on the parent dashboard with a searchable, sortable browsing history table showing domain, URL, timestamp, and duration\n- Existing events, sessions, and daily_usage functionality is unaffected\n- Passes `mypy --strict` type checking\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Verify `browsing_history` table is created on `kidsafe start`\n- [ ] Confirm browsing history is recorded while Firefox kiosk is running\n- [ ] Test `GET /api/browsing-history` returns paginated JSON\n- [ ] Test `GET /api/browsing-history?domain=youtube` filters by domain\n- [ ] Test `GET /api/browsing-history?date_from=2026-03-01&date_to=2026-03-10` filters by date range\n- [ ] Verify Activity tab displays and search/sort/pagination work\n- [ ] Confirm existing dashboard tabs (status, settings, events, usage history) are unaffected\nEOF\n)\" --base main 2>&1","description":"Create pull request"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":412,"cache_read_input_tokens":108269,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":412},"output_tokens":24,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_i