{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01NuU2HRK962aronUwEFtrMH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PR created: https://github.com/tonycodes/kidsafe/pull/2\n\nHere's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n**Database** (`init_db()`):\n- New `browsing_history` table with columns: `id`, `timestamp`, `domain`, `url`, `duration_seconds`\n- Indexes on `timestamp` and `domain` for query performance\n\n**Data Capture** (`BrowsingTracker` class):\n- Background thread polls Firefox's `places.sqlite` every 30 seconds\n- Copies the DB file to avoid locking conflicts with Firefox\n- Initializes `last_visit_id` to current max on startup (avoids importing old history)\n- Tracks page duration by recording time between navigation events\n- Skips internal Firefox URLs (`about:`, `moz-`, `chrome:`, etc.)\n- Starts/stops automatically with the `KioskManager`\n\n**API** (`GET /api/browsing-history`):\n- Paginated results (default 50 per page, max 100)\n- Query params: `page`, `per_page`, `domain` (partial match), `date_from`, `date_to`\n- Returns: `{items, total, page, per_page, total_pages}`\n\n**Dashboard**:\n- Tab navigation (Overview + Activity tabs)\n- Activity tab shows browsing history table with domain, URL, timestamp, duration columns\n- Domain search filter, date range filters\n- Sortable columns (domain, timestamp, duration)\n- Previous/Next pagination controls\n- Duration formatted as human-readable (e.g., \"2m 30s\")"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":485,"cache_read_input_tokens":108681,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":485},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5f02eaca-ad87-4794-81b5-499b307ad8d6","uuid":"3ec8964f-1405-46c7-bf40-5acecd59a0ab"}
